   Archicad checks both values and rejects anything else with
   "This add-on cannot be validated". These IDs are registered for Baaz;
   a fork that distributes its own build needs its own IDs. For local testing
   with another MDID see BAAZ_DEV_MDID in addon/CMakeLists.txt. */
'MDID' 32500 "Add-On Identifier" {
	829510500
	440734808
}
